<p>Ukraine launched one of its largest drone attacks on Russia overnight into Sunday, with strikes reported across Russian regions, including the Moscow area and Belgorod, Russian and local authorities said. Russia’s Defense Ministry said air defenses shot down 556 drones overnight and into the morning; local officials said at least four people were killed, including three in the Moscow region and one in Belgorod, and about a dozen others were wounded. Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelenskyy confirmed the strikes and said they were a response to Russia’s continued war and attacks on Ukrainian cities. The attack followed Russian strikes on Kyiv two days earlier that Ukrainian authorities said killed 24 people. Moscow region Governor Andrey Vorobyov said two men died in Pogorelki near Mytishchi and a woman died after a drone struck a home in Khimki. Belgorod authorities said the fourth death was a man whose truck was struck by a drone in the border region. India’s embassy in Russia said an Indian worker was among those killed in the Moscow-region attack.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/3FakrEobqXza_aGRN2jvmLQTIqm6kfMvBEtTCFWKGaRbqT8bTm8ovl2BJKXpJh2aJ9x9_BRvsMtOJLMIC3Bk8uRep3XcOsV2zX_fxv8wAg' alt='An apartment building damaged in a Ukrainian drone attack in Krasnogorsk, in the Moscow region, Russia, on Sunday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Geographic scope: The wave hit 14 Russian regions, as well as Crimea and the Black and Azov seas, Russia’s Defense Ministry said.</li><li>Moscow approaches: State agency Tass, citing Moscow Mayor Sergei Sobyanin, said 81 drones headed for Moscow had been destroyed since midnight.</li><li>Daily interceptions: Russia’s Defense Ministry said by midday that air defenses had downed more than 1,000 Ukrainian drones over Russia in the previous 24 hours.</li></ul><blockquote>Our responses to Russia&#x27;s prolongation of the war and its attacks on our cities and communities are entirely justified - Volodymyr Zelenskyy</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Volodymyr Zelenskyy: Zelenskyy said Ukraine could strike targets more than 500 km from the border despite dense Russian air defenses around Moscow, and that Russia must end its war. (<a href='https://www.newarab.com/news/ukraine-drones-kill-four-moscow-faces-biggest-attack-year'>The New Arab</a>)</li><li>Russian Foreign Ministry: Foreign Ministry spokeswoman Maria Zakharova accused Kyiv of carrying out a “mass terrorist attack” and said civilians had been targeted. (<a href='https://www.newarab.com/news/ukraine-drones-kill-four-moscow-faces-biggest-attack-year'>The New Arab</a>)</li><li>Ukraine’s Defense Ministry: The ministry said the Moscow region faced the largest drone attack of the full-scale war and that several strategic facilities reportedly were struck for the first time. (<a href='https://english.nv.ua/nation/ukraine-says-moscow-region-hit-in-largest-drone-attack-of-war-50608630.html'>NV</a>)</li><li>Ukraine’s Security Service: The SBU said strikes on defense-industry, military and oil infrastructure reduce Russia’s ability to continue the war against Ukraine. (<a href='https://www.newsbeast.gr/world/arthro/13103610/rosia-nekros-indos-ergazomenos-kai-3-travmaties-meta-tin-epithesi-oukranikon-drones-se-diylistirio-petrelaiou'>Newsbeast</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/05/17/world/europe/russia-ukraine-strikes-moscow.html'>Wave of Ukrainian Strikes Kills at Least 4, Russia Says</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/international/article/2026/05/17/large-scale-ukraine-drone-strike-kills-at-least-4-in-russia_6753532_4.html'>Large-scale Ukraine drone strike kills at least 4 in Russia</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/ukraine-drone-attack-kills-at-least-three-in-moscow-region-governor-says/article70989743.ece'>At least four people killed in one of the largest Ukrainian drone strikes on Russia</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><